| 4 Arena | Keyboard orb destroys targets | 10-minute stable session |
| 5 Ember | Live hand cast | 8/10 casts, ≤1 accidental / 2 min |
| 6 Aegis | Block incoming hazard | Fresh tester from tutorial |
